cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Loaded CMJ System Identification"
message: "If you use this software, please cite this version."
type: software
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Full-morphology MuJoCo loaded countermovement-jump system identification with
  bilateral force-platform measurements, a bar-mounted linear-position
  transducer model, deterministic synthetic trials, mechanics-first validation,
  and MakeHuman scientific visualization.
authors:
  - name: "Loaded CMJ research contributors"
